    "need": "Our library needs a right-pointing return arrow embroidered on a navy canvas apron. Give our volunteer machine operator a ZIP with a Tajima DST file and the directions to use it as delivered. One white thread; the stitched arrow should be 32 ± 1 mm wide by 16 ± 1 mm high, centered on the hoop origin within 0.5 mm on both axes. From the wearer’s front it must point right, with a straight-sided tail 6 ± 1 mm high on the left. An outline is fine. The hoop field is 60 × 40 mm. The operator can load and stitch a sample, but cannot redraw, scale or mirror a design. The volunteer is not here today.",
